<title>LIBYA: Russia's Zhirinovsky meets Gaddafi in Libya.</title>
<headline>Russia's Zhirinovsky meets Gaddafi in Libya.</headline>
<dateline>TRIPOLI 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian ultra-nationalist leader Vladimir Zhirinovsky held talks with Libyan leader Muammar Gaddafi, Libya's state-run television said on Sunday.</p>
<p>A delegation of Russian members of parliament accompanied Zhirinovsky in the meeting with Gaddafi on Saturday night, it said without giving further details.</p>
<p>Zhirinovsky arrived on Wednesday night in Tripoli for his fourth visit to Libya. His last visit was in January when he also met Gaddafi.</p>
